/T (Furthermore, building a web-native solution avoids the friction of downloading large installer packages or requiring high-end dedicated graphics processing units [9], [23]. By optimizing a lightweight 2.5D canvas presentation, we ensure that every student with a basic laptop or mobile browser can explore the campus without performance bottlenecks [9], [23].)
/E (Furthermore, building a web-native solution avoids the friction of downloading large installer packages or requiring high-end dedicated graphics processing units [9], [23]. By optimizing a lightweight 2.5D canvas presentation, we ensure that every student with a basic laptop or mobile browser can explore the campus without performance bottlenecks [9], [23].)
