/T (The assistant subsystem is designed around a provider abstraction layer. The active provider is determined by the AI_PROVIDER environment variable, defaulting to 'mock'. When configured with valid API keys, the service can route queries to Gemini, OpenAI, or Anthropic. If an external API call times out or fails, the system automatically falls back to the deterministic local mock provider, ensuring that navigation, location lookup, and campus advice always return reliable structured actions.)
/E (The assistant subsystem is designed around a provider abstraction layer. The active provider is determined by the AI_PROVIDER environment variable, defaulting to 'mock'. When configured with valid API keys, the service can route queries to Gemini, OpenAI, or Anthropic. If an external API call times out or fails, the system automatically falls back to the deterministic local mock provider, ensuring that navigation, location lookup, and campus advice always return reliable structured actions.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
529 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 180 0 R
/T (The application implements a dual-mode persistence architecture. In Demo Mode, the server loads bundled JSON campus datasets and maintains favourites in memory. When a valid MONGODB_URI is provided, Mongoose models persist users, locations, NPCs, navigation logs, and classroom records. If the database connection fails, the server gracefully reverts to Demo Mode, guaranteeing uninterrupted demonstration during viva presentations.)
/E (The application implements a dual-mode persistence architecture. In Demo Mode, the server loads bundled JSON campus datasets and maintains favourites in memory. When a valid MONGODB_URI is provided, Mongoose models persist users, locations, NPCs, navigation logs, and classroom records. If the database connection fails, the server gracefully reverts to Demo Mode, guaranteeing uninterrupted demonstration during viva presentations.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
