/T (The classroom subsystem integrates room-scoped WebSocket communication and LiveKit WebRTC media streams. Academic buildings \(Lecture Hall Complex Block A and Aryabhata Classroom Complex Block B\) host isolated virtual rooms \(e.g., LH-101, LH-102\). The backend validates room IDs, generates participant tokens, tracks attendance, and synchronizes whiteboard drawing strokes, chat messages, and hand-raise alerts.)
/E (The classroom subsystem integrates room-scoped WebSocket communication and LiveKit WebRTC media streams. Academic buildings \(Lecture Hall Complex Block A and Aryabhata Classroom Complex Block B\) host isolated virtual rooms \(e.g., LH-101, LH-102\). The backend validates room IDs, generates participant tokens, tracks attendance, and synchronizes whiteboard drawing strokes, chat messages, and hand-raise alerts.)
