913 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 197 0 R
/T (The IIIT BHOPAL METAVERSE project demonstrates that an engaging, practical digital campus twin can be successfully engineered using lightweight web technologies without requiring proprietary game engines or high-end graphics hardware. By combining React 18, Phaser 3, Node.js, and Express, we created a responsive 2.5D virtual world that combines spatial exploration, facility information, and obstacle-avoiding navigation into an intuitive browser application. The integrated A* algorithm computes accurate walking trajectories in milliseconds, while the dual-mode backend ensures flawless offline operation during academic demonstrations. The addition of conversational guidance and virtual classroom modules transforms the application from a passive map into an active institutional platform.)
/E (The IIIT BHOPAL METAVERSE project demonstrates that an engaging, practical digital campus twin can be successfully engineered using lightweight web technologies without requiring proprietary game engines or high-end graphics hardware. By combining React 18, Phaser 3, Node.js, and Express, we created a responsive 2.5D virtual world that combines spatial exploration, facility information, and obstacle-avoiding navigation into an intuitive browser application. The integrated A* algorithm computes accurate walking trajectories in milliseconds, while the dual-mode backend ensures flawless offline operation during academic demonstrations. The addition of conversational guidance and virtual classroom modules transforms the application from a passive map into an active institutional platform.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [2]
>>
