2606 0 obj
<<
/Title (to help students, faculty members, and campus visitors explore selected areas of the IIIT Bhopal campus. Rather than relying on disconnected static floor plans or generic satellite maps, users can control a custom student avatar within a responsive 2.5D virtual environment. The application brings spatial navigation, comprehensive facility information, and institutional directory lookups into a unified, lightweight interface.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2239 0 R
/Prev 2483 0 R
/Next 2613 0 R
>>
endobj
2607 0 obj
<<
/Title (The backend is built with Node.js and Express, exposing structured REST endpoints for campus configuration, location records, spatial search, and route calculation. It includes a resilient dual-mode architecture that operates in a zero-dependency in-memory demo mode when a database connection is absent, while seamlessly integrating with MongoDB via Mongoose when configured. The system incorporates an A* pathfinding engine that computes collision-free walking trajectories, calculates realistic physical distances in meters, and estimates transit times at human walking speeds.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2239 0 R
/Prev 2613 0 R
/Next 2484 0 R
>>
endobj
