/Title (The scope of this report covers the functional web prototype, its coordinate mapping models, heuristic graph algorithms, and dual-mode data persistence architecture [13], [22]. The project models key academic buildings and selected surrounding facilities on the transit campus; it does not claim to provide a full structural millimeter-accurate survey of all physical infrastructure [13], [22].)
