/Title (The assistant subsystem is designed around a provider abstraction layer. The active provider is determined by the AI_PROVIDER environment variable, defaulting to 'mock'. When configured with valid API keys, the service can route queries to Gemini, OpenAI, or Anthropic. If an external API call times out or fails, the system automatically falls back to the deterministic local mock provider, ensuring that navigation, location lookup, and campus advice always return reliable structured actions.)
